{"actions":[{"actionCode":null,"actionDate":"2026-03-19","source":"Senate","text":"Received in the Senate and Read twice and referred to the Committee on Environment and Public Works.","type":"IntroReferral"},{"actionCode":"H38310","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Motion to reconsider laid on the table Agreed to without objection.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H37100","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"On passage Passed by recorded vote: 215 - 202 (Roll no. 93). (text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H2576)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"8000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Passed/agreed to in House: On passage Passed by recorded vote: 215 - 202 (Roll no. 93). (text of amendment in the nature of a substitute: CR H2576)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36210","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"On motion to recommit Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 206 - 209 (Roll no. 92).","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2581-2582)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - At the conclusion of debate on H.R. 556, the Chair put the question on the motion to recommit and by voice vote, announced the noes had prevailed. Mrs. Dingell demanded the yeas and nays and the Chair postponed further proceedings until a time to be announced.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8A000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question on the motion to recommit was ordered pursuant to clause 2(b) of rule XIX.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H36200","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Mrs. Dingell moved to recommit to the Committee on Natural Resources. (text: CR H2580)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 556.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 556, H.R. 1958 and H.R. 4638. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 556, H.R. 1958, and H.R. 4638 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2026-03-18","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1115. (consideration: CR H2576-2580)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H1L210","actionDate":"2026-03-16","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1115 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 556, H.R. 1958 and H.R. 4638. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 556, H.R. 1958, and H.R. 4638 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H12410","actionDate":"2025-11-25","source":"House floor actions","text":"Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 335.","type":"Calendars"},{"actionCode":"H12300","actionDate":"2025-11-25","source":"House floor actions","text":"Committee on Agriculture discharged.","type":"Discharge"},{"actionCode":"5500","actionDate":"2025-11-25","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Committee on Agriculture discharged.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H12200","actionDate":"2025-11-25","source":"House floor actions","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Natural Resources. H. Rept. 119-385, Part I.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"5000","actionDate":"2025-